From ub27d618f22c908c3 at groups.google.com  Mon Feb 18 13:57:10 2013
From: ub27d618f22c908c3 at groups.google.com (david golan)
Date: Mon, 18 Feb 2013 13:57:10 +0000
Subject: Re: [Israel RUG] residuals
Message-ID: <3L4-2TtSaOk.EhnUDJnm5XgJ@israel-r-user-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <3L4-2TtSaOk.egziGoZGynAJ@israel-r-user-group.groups.google.com>
References: <3L4-2TtSaOk.egziGoZGynAJ@israel-r-user-group.groups.google.com>
